  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='text-indent:0px; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial; display:inline !important;'>\n<div>This data set includes the geographic locations for all open English Public, English Catholic, French Public and French Catholic schools in Ontario.</div> \n<div><br /></div>\n<div> <strong>Additional Documentation<br /></strong></div><div><ul><li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/School%20Facility%20-%20Data%20Description.pdf' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>School Facility - Data Description (PDF)</a></li><li><a href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/School Facility - Documentation.docx' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>School Facility - Documentation (Word)</a></li></ul></div> \n\n<div><strong>Status</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>On going: data is being continually updated<br /></div> \n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Weekly: data is updated on a weekly basis<br /></div> \n\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div><strong>Contact</strong><br /></div>\n\n<div>Cindy Lu, Community Services and I &amp; IT Cluster <a href='mailto:cindy.lu@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>cindy.lu@ontario.ca</a></div>\n<div><br /></div>\n\n<div>The data referenced here is licensed under the Ontario Geospatial Data Exchange (OGDE) Agreement and is available to members of the OGDE for professional, non-commercial use only.  To find out more about the OGDE visit <a href='https://www.ontario.ca/page/land-information-ontario' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Land Information Ontario</a> on Ontario.ca.</div>\n</span>"
